start": 11, "end": 155, "text": "The Great Depression curtailed many of the denomination ’ s activities , whether church-building campaigns , Sunday schools , or missions work ."}, "D7S3": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d06", "start": 156, "end": 357, "text": "World War II ( 1941-45 ) , however , once more resuscitated Lutheran communities , bringing another round of church founding during the 1950s and 1960s , particularly in Atlanta ’ s expanding suburbs ."}, "D7S4": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d06", "start": 358, "end": 562, "text": "By 1960 the American Lutheran Church had joined the synodical family of Georgia ’ s various Lutheran groups , and all together this assortment of synods maintained more than eighty churches in the state ."}, "D7S5": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d06", "start": 563, "end": 597, "text": "In 2000 metropolitan Atlanta alone"}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "1884", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d00:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "1920", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d01:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C2", "answer": "1929", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d02:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C3", "answer": "1862", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d03:c0", "ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d04:c0", "ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d05:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d00:c0", "entity": "Christ Lutheran Church", "scope": "founded", "claim": "Christ Evangelical Lutheran Church was founded in 1884.", "answer": "1884", "quote": "Christ Evangelical Lutheran Church was founded in 1884 by thirteen families who were peacefully released from St.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d01", "card_id": "ramdocs-0358-c07b1d2042d8:d01:c0", "entity": "Christ Lutheran Church", "scope": "founded", "claim": "Christ Evangelica